      </div>
      {{/unless}}
    </div>
    {{/unless}}
    {{! =========================== END WORLD ========================== }}
  </div>

  {{! Footer Bar: the one door to the overlay dictionary.
      ONE button, not two. Moods and Phases are a single window (OverlayConfigApp) that the two
      former buttons both opened - same id, same markup, differing only in which tab was showing
      (docs/wiki/ux.md D4). Two doors onto one room taught the GM that they were two rooms, and
      named the destination in a third way besides ("Moods & Phases"). See UX-5. }}
  <div class="tree-footer-bar flexrow">
    <button type="button" class="mood-config-btn" data-action="openOverlayConfig" data-tooltip="{{localize 'GameOrchestra.OverlayConfig.Hint'}}">
      <i class="fas fa-masks-theater"></i> {{localize "GameOrchestra.OverlayConfig.Title"}}
    </button>
  </div>
</div>
